    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "An update is available for oci-delta.\nThis update affects Rocky Linux 9.\nA Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE list",
        "title": "Topic"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "Creates and applies delta files between OCI image archives for bootc systems. Delta files are significantly smaller than full OCI archives because they exclude layers already present on the target system and use binary diffs (tar-diff) for changed layers.\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Update oci-delta to v0.3.1 for Rocky Linux 9.9.z async release (JIRA:Rocky Linux-294259)\n\nThis advisory is provided by Ctrl IQ, Inc for Rocky Linux systems. For more information about CIQ security practices, visit https://ciq.com/security.",
        "title": "Description"
      },
      {
